1
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:16,060
[Episode 22]

3
00:01:35,990 --> 00:01:38,400
[Zhao Xiao's Birthday Fan Meeting]

4
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:50,710
I'm honored to be recognized by my peers

5
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:52,350
and by so many fans.

6
00:01:52,950 --> 00:02:00,490
[Zhao Xiao's Birthday Party]

7
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:54,930
Walking up here from the audience

8
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:56,170
was only a few steps,

9
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,090
but getting to where I am today

10
00:01:59,090 --> 00:02:00,750
took a very, very long time.

11
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,190
First, I want to thank myself

12
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:07,230
for not giving up
after the crash that scarred my face.

13
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:09,479
[Zhao Xiao's Birthday Fan Meeting]

14
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,570
But the person I want to thank most

15
00:02:09,570 --> 00:02:12,680
[Zhao Xiao's Birthday Party]

16
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,870
is the director of "The Husband's Trap,"

17
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:12,890
Ms. Xu Jing.

18
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,620
Without her support and encouragement,

19
00:02:16,930 --> 00:02:18,579
I wouldn't be standing here.

20
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,970
So please allow me

21
00:02:20,990 --> 00:02:22,680
to invite Ms. Xu Jing to the stage

22
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,030
to share with me

23
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:25,440
these birthday wishes.

24
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:04,510
Thank you.

25
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:05,710
Xu Jing.

26
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,120
A'Lan.

27
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,430
Without you,

28
00:03:22,570 --> 00:03:24,030
I'd rather have no future.

29
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,230
Will you marry me?

30
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,220
I do.

31
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:10,560
Finally,

32
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:11,820
I want to say,

33
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:13,240
in the future...

34
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,200
[Secrets of the Spotlight Bar]

35
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:19,950
[Zhao Xiao's "girl-hunting"
scheme in showbiz]

36
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,310
Who is this?

37
00:04:22,350 --> 00:04:23,390
Is this for real?

38
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,950
How could he do so many awful things?

39
00:04:25,990 --> 00:04:26,790
This is so detailed.

40
00:04:26,790 --> 00:04:27,520
Evidence.

41
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:28,560
[Victim: Lu Yao]
[Victim: Lin Xuan] [Victim: Lyu Hong]

42
00:04:27,550 --> 00:04:28,550
It was all him.

43
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:31,790
-Hard to believe.
-So shameless.

44
00:04:31,790 --> 00:04:32,420
[Zhao Xiao deceived multiple victims]

45
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:33,190
That's disgusting.

46
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,420
[Providing their skin test reports]

47
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:34,020
Yeah.

48
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:35,560
[Zhao Xiao deceived multiple victims]

49
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:35,710
[Providing their skin test reports]

50
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:40,430
Who's setting me up?

51
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,790
What are you doing?

52
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,460
Turn this off! Now!

53
00:04:46,530 --> 00:04:47,600
I have no idea.

54
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:50,970
Everyone,

55
00:04:51,870 --> 00:04:53,130
what you're seeing now

56
00:04:53,150 --> 00:04:55,480
are all Zhao Xiao's crimes.

57
00:04:55,570 --> 00:04:56,690
His fan, Wang Yue,

58
00:04:56,930 --> 00:04:58,870
was no mental patient,

59
00:04:59,670 --> 00:05:02,620
but a victim who chose to end her own life

60
00:05:02,850 --> 00:05:05,110
under Zhao Xiao's mind control and lies.

61
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:07,380
And the reason she killed herself

62
00:05:07,550 --> 00:05:08,430
was that Zhao Xiao,

63
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:10,590
riding on Wang Yue's
love and admiration for him,

64
00:05:10,590 --> 00:05:12,360
wanted the skin from her face

65
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,620
for his own graft.

66
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:14,870
What's worse,

67
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,360
countless young girls

68
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,040
were forced into the dirty business

69
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,870
of the industry Zhao Xiao ran.

70
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,330
Those nameless victims

71
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,910
were Zhao Xiao's stepping stones.

72
00:05:25,910 --> 00:05:28,370
Step by step,
he climbed to where he is today.

73
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:33,000
Let me go!

74
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:33,920
Let me go!

75
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,450
I'm a reporter with H Daily.

76
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:37,020
The story on Wang Yue's suicide

77
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,280
was buried overnight.

78
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:40,090
Were you the one behind it?

79
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,390
In all your crimes,

80
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:42,380
who else helped you?

81
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,159
Zhao Xiao, back in the fan group,

82
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:46,090
you quietly pushed everyone
to get hospital checkups.

83
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:47,920
Were you planning all along

84
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,490
to pick out a skin match from among them?

85
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:51,190
I saw it myself at the Spotlight Bar.

86
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:53,159
Girls going in and out
of those private rooms.

87
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:55,290
Are the rumors of illegal deals true?

88
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,880
Whose skin is on your face?

89
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,300
Who's the real victim?

90
00:05:58,870 --> 00:05:59,790
I know.

91
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,600
You're all dying to know

92
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,510
whose skin is on Zhao Xiao's face.

93
00:06:05,530 --> 00:06:08,520
He went to great lengths
to con his ex-wife, A'lan,

94
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,070
into giving it to him.

95
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,090
And his ex-wife, A'lan,

96
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,740
was abandoned by him after he used her.

97
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,530
Impossible.

98
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,770
That nasty woman.

99
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:22,880
She's raving! She's lost her mind!

100
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:26,060
A'lan gave me her skin willingly!

101
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,030
Right, A'lan.

102
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:29,980
I'll call A'lan right now.

103
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,530
She can prove I'm innocent.

104
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:51,820
Zhao Xiao.

105
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:54,650
[Zhao Xiao]

106
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,020
I'm your ex-wife,

107
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,140
A'lan.

108
00:06:56,790 --> 00:06:57,790
Is that true?

109
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,240
He's horrible.

110
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,600
Impossible.

111
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:04,920
Where's A'lan?

112
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,260
Give A'lan back to me!

113
00:07:09,810 --> 00:07:10,790
She's lying!

114
00:07:10,870 --> 00:07:12,120
I'm innocent!

115
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,860
I didn't do those things!

116
00:07:17,130 --> 00:07:18,290
You nasty woman!

117
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:20,130
I'm going to kill you!

118
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,840
[Breaking News
from the Entertainment World]

119
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:41,080
[Chaos at Zhao Xiao's party—
Zhao Xiao loses control]

120
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,640
Can't you understand me?

121
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:44,470
Move every asset we can move.

122
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:45,360
All of it!

123
00:07:55,610 --> 00:07:56,430
If you're running away,

124
00:07:56,430 --> 00:07:58,690
you don't need that many clothes, do you?

125
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,720
Xu Jing.

126
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,160
No.

127
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,590
A'lan.

128
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:14,760
You played such a long game

129
00:08:15,190 --> 00:08:17,100
just to watch me go down in public.

130
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,270
You planned this for so long.

131
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:21,600
You got what you wanted.

132
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,530
Happy now?

133
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:24,480
Go down in public? That's nothing.

134
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:28,820
What I want

135
00:08:30,690 --> 00:08:32,110
goes far beyond that.

136
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,720
You can smear me all you want,

137
00:08:38,010 --> 00:08:39,960
but as for solid legal evidence,

138
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:41,750
with what you've got,

139
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:44,400
you'll never find a thing.

140
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,270
Indeed.

141
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:48,600
I know how careful you are, Zhao Xiao.

142
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,550
You get other people's hands bloody,

143
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:52,830
but never a drop on your own.

144
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:56,600
You used your mom and brother
as your shields.

145
00:08:57,430 --> 00:08:58,670
I'm impressed.

146
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,790
Psycho.

147
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:05,080
But even the best plans have holes.

148
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:10,530
Take a look at the penalty clause.

149
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,390
Bitch!

150
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:29,790
You set this up from the start—

151
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:32,550
to wreck my name at my birthday party

152
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,400
so I'd owe you
a thousand times the penalty.

153
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:41,230
Hundreds, thousands,
millions, tens of millions...

154
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:45,350
Two hands aren't enough to count it all.

155
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:46,910
You think

156
00:09:46,910 --> 00:09:48,870
you're the only one
who can play this game?

157
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:50,000
Let me tell you,

158
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,790
I just never bothered

159
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:53,520
with that kind of thing before.

160
00:09:55,510 --> 00:09:57,110
So what if you can't count it?

161
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,550
Then sue me.

162
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,580
Before the legal process even finishes,

163
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,450
let's see if you can find me.

164
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,360
Is that so?

165
00:10:08,450 --> 00:10:11,150
Then what about that skin-match report

166
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,300
between you and Wang Yue?

167
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:14,240
A fan follows her idol.

168
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,930
The idol gets into a car crash.

169
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,290
So what else can the fan do

170
00:10:18,490 --> 00:10:19,980
but give up her own face

171
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:22,360
to keep his career alive?

172
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,840
Perfectly reasonable.

173
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,070
What did you just say?

174
00:10:29,540 --> 00:10:31,030
I can't find the evidence?

175
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,880
You think you can get away today?

176
00:10:34,510 --> 00:10:36,110
The penalty doesn't matter.

177
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,220
What matters

178
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,600
is I'm sending you to jail

179
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,570
to keep your mother company.

180
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,420
Then I'll kill you!

181
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,760
That way, I can get away.

182
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,210
You're insane.

183
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,320
If you kill me,

184
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,050
you won't survive either.

185
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,860
Where do you think Lin Di'er went?

186
00:10:58,070 --> 00:10:59,860
Killing one

187
00:10:59,890 --> 00:11:01,580
is the same as killing two.

188
00:11:02,710 --> 00:11:04,780
You two can keep each other company.
